  steps: "M10 6h11M10 12h11M10 18h11M3 6l1.5 1.5L7 5M3 12l1.5 1.5L7 11m-2.5 8.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Z",
